{"title":"规范、高效，促进健康有序发展","date":"2017-11-28","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast\">规范、高效，促进健康有序发展<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast\">11</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast\">月<span lang=\"EN-US\">25-26</span>日，广东省项目管理协会根据广东省社会组织管理局的要求，选派代表邓剑峰等人参加广东省社会组织法人治理与规范发展培训班。</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201711/1.jpg\" style=\"width: 1440px; height: 1080px;\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t<span style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt; text-indent: 28pt;\">本期培训班是广东省社会组织管理局为了贯彻落实中办、国办《关于改革社会组织管理制度促进社会组织健康有序发展的意见》和省委办公厅、省政府办公厅《关于改革社会组织管理制度促进社会组织健康有序发展的实施意见》，委托广东省社会管理研究会在广东外语外贸大学白云校区组织举办。</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">广东省社会组织管理局庄侃局长作了开班动员，副局长黎建波进行了社会组织法人治理及案例教学，监管处副处长朱远辉进行了社会组织运作规范及案例教学，经济学博士涂斌教授进行了十九大报告精神专题教学，管理学博士、注册会计师柳絮教授进行了社会组织财务规范教学。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">参加本期培训班的有来自各行各业的协会、学会、研究会、基金会等<span lang=\"EN-US\">100</span>多家，报告厅座无虚席，参加培训的代表认真听取领导与专家教授的讲座与培训，并结合实际进行了互动。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">有所思！有所悟！有所得！有所践！通过本期的培训学习，进一步明确了广东省项目管理协会的使命感与责任感，将在一定程度上促进广东省项目管理协会朝着规范、高效、健康有序的发展！</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>"}